# A deliberately RESTRICTED speciation network is DECLARED, refused when dishonest,
# announced and labelled (DEV.md 4c D-R1; design record
# docs/design/restricted-speciation-network.md, approved 2026-08-02 with two
# conditions: the reduced network passes the same consistency machinery as the full
# one, and every result from a reduced model is clearly labelled).
# Former gate: check_restricted_network.py.  Probed through the real binary on the
# converted witness pitzer_seawater_verify (networkScope restricted / water-dissociation,
# stated once per pin, so the removals replace every occurrence).
#  witness   runs, ANNOUNCES the restriction, quotes the reason, carries the label.
#  1..5      no list / no reason / a name matching no loaded record / `networkScope
#            full` beside a list (two authorities) / an admitted record unreachable
#            from the feed (a restriction that restricts nothing is a false claim).
#  negative  an ordinary full-scope case carries NO announcement and NO label.
group      restricted-network
row        restricted-network-gate
binary     choupoProps
base       tutorials/props/electrolyte/pitzer_seawater_verify
strip      expected
timeout    900
ok_head    "check_restricted_network: OK -- "
fail_head  "check_restricted_network: FAIL"
ok         the declared restricted network announces itself and quotes its reason,
+          labels its results (networkRestricted), and refuses the five dishonest shapes
+          (no list / no reason / unknown record / two authorities / unreachable
+          admission); a full-scope case stays silent

control    WITNESS: announce + reason + label
  match    RESTRICTED network \(networkScope
  match    NON-pairing major-ion treatment
  match    networkRestricted

probe      REFUSAL-1 (no network list)
  editall  system/propsDict	network      ( water-dissociation );
  match    networkScope restricted
  match    requires a non-empty `network

probe      REFUSAL-2 (no reason)
  editall  system/propsDict	re:reason\s+"[^"]*";
  match    requires a non-empty `reason
  match    student

probe      REFUSAL-3 (unknown record name)
  editall  system/propsDict	network      ( water-dissociation );	network      ( no-such-record );
  match    'no-such-record'
  match    no loaded chemistry record
  match    Loaded records:

probe      REFUSAL-4 (full scope beside a list: two authorities)
  edit     system/propsDict	networkScope restricted;	networkScope full;
  match    TWO
  match    authorities

probe      REFUSAL-5 (admitted but unreachable from this feed)
  copy     constant/chemistry/CaSO4aq-formation.dat	data/standards/chemistry/CaSO4aq-formation.dat
  edit     system/propsDict	network      ( water-dissociation );	network      ( water-dissociation CaSO4aq-formation );
  match    unreachable from this feed

control    NEGATIVE (a full-scope case stays silent)
  base     tutorials/props/electrolyte/rainwater_air
  nomatch  RESTRICTED network
  nomatch  networkRestricted
